> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
> SELECT * FROM a12_sj j1, a12_sj j2
>   WHERE j1.b = j2.b AND 2 = j1.a AND j1.c = 3 AND j2.a = 1 AND 3 = j2.c
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop
  Join Filter: (j1.b = j2.b)
  ->  Seq Scan on a12_sj j1
        Filter: ((2 = a) AND (c = 3))
  ->  Seq Scan on a12_sj j2
        Filter: ((c = 3) AND (a = 1))
